srcset="https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery22_hu_1a0377db689d4102.jpg 480w, https://www.despairjasper.com/p/a-fantastic-journey-to-altay/scenery22_hu_bbe5f8fcde82b353.jpg 1024w"
loading="lazy"
alt="A strange right-angled tree on the Rock Painting boardwalk"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="177"
data-flex-basis="426px"
>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The next day, we saw another side of Kanas Lake at the Three Bays.&lt;/p>
